    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the sprite thing is a cool way to look at it. but i'm curious about the \"disorganized\" part you mentioned. if they're just rushing along, does anything ever go wrong? \n\nlike, what happens if those sprites get interrupted or if they don't behave? is there anything that actually disrupts that flow or makes the air act up so the plane doesn't fly as well?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
